                            "body": "Dear Parents,\n\nOur system detected that the following student(s) may have missed their scheduled tennis session today ({{step_8['notifications'][0]['session_date']}}):\n\n{% for n in step_8['notifications'] %}\n  - {{n.student_name}} (scheduled at {{n.session_time}})\n{% endfor %}\n\nIf this absence was not intended, please contact your coach or the academy administration.\n\n{% if step_8['notification_count'] == 1 %}\nWe hope everything is okay with {{step_8['notifications'][0]['student_name']}}. Regular attendance is important for consistent progress. If your child was present and this notification was sent in error, please reach out and we'll update our records.\n{% else %}\nWe hope everything is okay. Regular attendance is important for consistent progress. If any students were present and this notification was sent in error, please reach out and we'll update our records.\n{% endif %}\n\nThis is an automated alert from the Tennis Academy Management platform.\nNotification sent {{step_8['delay_hours']}} hours after the scheduled session time.\n\n— Tennis Academy Management",
